I am new to application of INLA. I am working on a project with three responses that I need to model jointly.  I have done the unstructured and spatially structured components for each of these responses without joint modeling and things have run well. I now want to model them jointly and I don't how to go about it in INLA. Can someone shed light on how to go about this or referral to any material that can be helpful?

From uafb003e064114795 at groups.google.com  Thu Aug 20 21:39:56 2020
From: uafb003e064114795 at groups.google.com (Finn Lindgren)
