Hi Denise,

The code to do this in an accepted upcoming paper but a previous version is available on https://arxiv.org/pdf/1907.10426.pdf. It is example 2.

It follows along the lines of the FAQ http://www.r-inla.org/faq#TOC-Can-I-have-the-linear-predictor-from-one-model-as-a-covariate-in-a-different-model-

Contact me at Janet.va...@kaust.edu.sa if you need more details.

